            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "710600101",
                    "speaker": "Kapral Nikolay's Letter",
                    "text": "(This is the letter that Katarina once treasured. The letter still has a light and lingering scent of Fire-Water.)"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7105911",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "710591101",
                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                    "text": "What? Are you here to disturb my rest?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "710591102",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Nope, we just wanna talk to you, seeing you sitting here all by your lonesome.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "710591103",
                            "text": "It must be quite boring to drink alone.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "710591105",
                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                    "text": "Is that so? Thank you. You... remind me of Lyudochka."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "710591106",
                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                    "text": "She's really enthusiastic, just like you... She kept sticking with me, telling me all sorts of things... I was the only one she often confided certain things to."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "710591107",
                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                    "text": "*sigh* How I wish she was around. She's such a fun person. I bet you'd like her if you saw her.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "710591108",
                                            "text": "Lyudochka? Who is she?",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "710591109",
                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                    "text": "A friend of mine. Though she may appear serious, she's a funny little pumpkin."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "710591110",
                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                    "text": "We were like sisters back in the House of the Hearth — I'd say that she was even dearer than a real sister. She liked to tease me... And she also looked after me."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "710591111",
                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                    "text": "Haha, anyway, I have a hunch that she's doing fine out there. With this thought in mind, all the injuries that I got in this hell of a place seem to feel like nothing."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "710591112",
                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                    "text": "I hope she's doing her job alright... Hope she doesn't think of me."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "710591113",
                                            "text": "Lyudochka... You mean the one in Inazuma...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "710591114",
                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                    "text": "..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "710591115",
                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                    "text": "So, her cover was blown..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "710591116",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Eh, how did you know?",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "710591117",
                                                            "text": "She... managed to escape.",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "710591119",
                                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                                    "text": "Really?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "710591120",
                                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                                    "text": "Haha... That's a relief to know. Let's hope she's still doing her job well."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "710591121",
                                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                                    "text": "But if she betrays the Tsaritsa for fear of death..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "710591122",
                                                                    "speaker": "Katarina",
                                                                    "text": "...I hope she doesn't think of me."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "710591118",
                                                            "text": "She's still alive, and she's doing great."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "710591104",
                            "text": "So we came over for a chat."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
